# Contact form delivery (Scene 8). Server-only: never prefix these with NEXT_PUBLIC_.
# With nothing set, the form explains that the contact service is not connected
# yet and sends nothing. Copy to .env.local (or set in your host) to enable.

# Optional: force a provider ("resend" or "webhook"). Otherwise the first fully
# configured one is used.
# CONTACT_PROVIDER=resend

# Option A — email via Resend (https://resend.com). The from address must be on a
# domain verified in Resend. CONTACT_TO_EMAIL accepts a comma-separated list.
# RESEND_API_KEY=
# CONTACT_TO_EMAIL=
# CONTACT_FROM_EMAIL=

# Option B — POST each inquiry as JSON to your own endpoint (CRM, automation, …).
# With a secret, requests carry X-FASFAR-Signature: sha256=<HMAC-SHA256 of the body>.
# CONTACT_WEBHOOK_URL=
# CONTACT_WEBHOOK_SECRET=
